{"id":"039f6c958e772c3f","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-recognition-enumeration-equivalence.md","title":"可识别语言与有效枚举等价","display":"thm-recognition-enumeration-equivalence — 可识别语言与有效枚举等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-recognition-enumeration-equivalence","aliases":["73-thm-recognition-enumeration-equivalence"],"display":"thm-recognition-enumeration-equivalence — 可识别语言与有效枚举等价","depends_on":["[[73-df-effective-language-enumeration]]","[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.2–8.6 and §9.2, print pp. 324–374, 384–390; PDF pp. 346–396, 406–412; local function/enumerator presentation","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§7.7, pp. 167–170; scans 175–178","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-recognition-enumeration-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-recognition-enumeration-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-recognition-enumeration-equivalence — 可识别语言与有效枚举等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5f443b8d76b30137\" href=\"?note=5f443b8d76b30137\" title=\"73-df-effective-language-enumeration\">73-df-effective-language-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.2–8.6 and §9.2, print pp. 324–374, 384–390; PDF pp. 346–396, 406–412; local function/enumerator presentation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§7.7, pp. 167–170; scans 175–178"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。枚举谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5f443b8d76b30137\" href=\"?note=5f443b8d76b30137\" title=\"73-df-effective-language-enumeration\">73-df-effective-language-enumeration</a>，识别类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recognition\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Enumerable}_{\\Sigma}(L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recognition\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Enumerable}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由总枚举识别时依次比较输出。反向对识别器在所有有限词上的运行作交错模拟，每当发现接受就输出该词；非空语言先等到第一个接受词，之后各有限阶段没有新词时重复这个已知词，使输出函数总定义。空语言使用单列分支。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-effective-language-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"5f443b8d76b30137","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-effective-language-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-effective-language-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"5f443b8d76b30137","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。枚举谓词见 [[73-df-effective-language-enumeration]]，识别类见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。枚举谓词见 [[73-df-effective-language-enumeration]]，识别类见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recognition\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Enumerable}_{\\Sigma}(L)","display":true}],"bytes":1735,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-t